 "strings": {
  "vs 六狂人 內藤": "",
  "vs 天島搭檔": "",
  "vs 六狂人 棚橋": "",
  "vs 喚雨人": "",
  "這傢伙就是JUSTIS的頭頭岡田和睦啊\n雖然他好像很強，但我不能輸！": "",
  "vs 殺月": "",
  "約好要教軌道車戰士的兒子崎斗怎麼玩\n軌道車了。之後再到La Pente附近來吧": "",
  "畠山先生的女兒好像在La Pente約會\n有點擔心跑去查看狀況的畠山先生啊": "",
  "vs 阿保": "",
  "vs 阿康": "",
  "vs 土橋": "",
  "vs 田之上": "",
  "vs 野上": "",
  "vs 武士": "",
  "vs 小原": "",
  "vs 城野": "",
  "vs 藤武": "",
  "vs 橋元": "",
  "前往APA酒店": "",
  "（第七章）\n……和秋山約好在劇場前廣場的\nAPA酒店見面了": "",
  "前往APA酒店6樓": "",
  "流行的健身房‧RIZAP\n想要加入會員，就去和健身房的教練談談吧": "",
  "vs JUSTIS": "",
  "打倒JUSTIS！": "",
  "在RIZAP健身": "",
  "RIZAP是嗎……\n既然已經成為會員了，趕緊來健身看看吧": "",
  "Snap a Photo": "",
  "Eliminate the Attackers": "",
  "Defend Yourself": "",
  "These guys are a real thorn in my side. Not much choice but to fight them, though.": "",
  "Head to Club Amour": "",
  "This is where Hamura abducted Kume on the night of the murder. It should be on Suppon Street.": "",
  "Capture the Horseplayer Detective": "",
  "Defeat the Horseplayer Detective": "",
  "This guy doesn't give up, does he? Guess I'll have to twist his arm.": "",
  "Defeat the Thugs": "",
  "This is a lot of crap, huh? Fine, have it your way!": "",
  "Defeat Murase": "",
  "He's one of the few people who knows what really happened. I'm gonna talk to him, one way or another.": "",
  "Chase the Masked Man": "",
  "Hey asshole, that's my phone! I need it!": "",
  "I'm counting on you, Kaito-san...": "",
  "Defeat the Clerk": "",
  "He has the nerve to punch a customer? I see why this place is dead.": "",
  "Defeat the Homeless Men": "",
  "Is there a reason for this!? What's he hiding about Red Nose!?": "",
  "Defeat Higashi": "",
  "Did Higashi really murder Red Nose? But if it's gotta come to this, then we're not gonna lie down and die!": "",
  "Defeat Shioya": "",
  "I didn't expect to reel in the Kyorei Clan's captain, but that was a tight spot. I'll get answers after I crush these guys.": "",
  "Chase the Mysterious Person": "",
  "Why eavesdrop on me? I better chase after him!": "",
  "Terasawa-san, a nurse from the ADDC? Why would she be eavesdropping!? But I'm not a groper, c'mon!": "",
  "Defeat the Mysterious Men": "",
  "I don't know where these guys are from, but Mafuyu is in danger! Outta my way!": "",
  "How dare he hit a woman!? I'm gonna hit him back for both of us!": "",
  "Raid Honmaruen": "",
  "I don't care if it's Murase or Shioya. I'll crush anyone here!": "",
  "Defeat the Matsugane Family": "",
  "Now that we know the Kyorei Clan and Kajihira are connected, of course the Matsugane Family wants me dead. It's too complicated!": "",
  "Defeat the Yakuza": "",
  "Running shakedowns in broad daylight? Pretty bold yakuza, if you ask me. I'll clear a path.": "",
  "Defeat Sakakiba": "",
  "What a character. But I wonder if his belly gets cold, hanging out like that? Think I could bribe him to stop this with a meal?": "",
  "I appreciate the warning, Matsugane-san. But this is too important to quit now. Sorry!": "",
  "Defeat Hamura": "",
  "He's not getting away this time! He's gonna spill everything!": "",
  "Defeat the Mysterious Assassin": "",
  "So he's coming straight at me, huh? He's different somehow!": "",
  "Defeat the Guards": "",
  "What's up with this thug? And here I was thinking I'd have to hold back.": "",
  "Capture Shono": "",
  "Got you, Shono! You're gonna talk!": "",
  "Chase Higashi": "",
  "He noticed me!? I can't lose sight of him, though!": "",
  "Remind me why I had to be the bait if this was how it was going to turn out, Kaito-san? Oh well. These guys probably know where Hamura is!": "",
  "Break through the Matsugane Family": "",
  "They're not the family I knew anymore. I need to get Matsugane-san out of here before the place burns down!": "",
  "Defeat Koga": "",
  "At least he's willing to listen to reason. But it's not like that stops him, so I guess I'll have to kick his ass.": "",
  "Defeat Kido": "",
  "I guess I should've expected that he'd have bodyguards. He's no fool. But I need him to be still be able to talk.": "",
  "Defeat the Love Hotel Guards": "",
  "Bingo. This is the place. Now to force my way through.": "",
  "Find the Secret Lab": "",
  "Shono's lab is in here somewhere, I know it! And that's gonna give me all the proof about human experimentation I need!": "",
  "Head to the Children's Park": "",
  "I can't believe we got attacked out in the open... These guys are getting desperate, huh?": "",
  "I understand wanting to avenge Matsunage-san, but the Mole needs to be tried. The rest is on me!": "",
  "Defeat Kuroiwa": "",
  "I didn't figure he'd be this bold. But I've had enough, already. I'd be glad to kick ass here and then in court!": "",
  "Step into the Back Alley": "",
  "Looks like the detective had money after all. Guess it's time to collect.": "",
  "Buy a Gift for the Office": "",
  "If I want Genda-sensei to give me some work, I better appeal to his sweet tooth. There's a convenience store right over on Tenkaichi Street.": "",
  "Head to Genda Law Office": "",
  "Let's hit up the old office.": "",
  "Inquire About a Job": "",
  "I can't believe how fast she... Oh well. I'll ask Genda-sensei if he's got any work.": "",
  "Head to Tender": "",
  "I haven't had to deal with a murder in a while. I'll meet Shintani at Tender.": "",
  "Head to the Kamurocho PD Station": "",
  "Captain Hamura got arrested? I better see what's up. I'll take a taxi to the station.": "",
  "Investigate Sauna Goten": "",
  "Hamura says he was at Sauna Goten on the night of the murder. Let's see if his alibi holds water...": "",
  "Rest up at Yagami Detective Agency": "",
  "Whew, busy day. I should head back to my office.": "",
  "Head to Café Mijore": "",
  "Café Mijore is on the second floor of a building on Nakamichi Street. Shintani can get testy if you keep him waiting...": "",
  "Head to KJ Art": "",
  "KJ Art is on Senryo Avenue? To think a Kansai operation would set up shop right under the Tojo Clan's nose... Hope it doesn't lead to war.": "",
  "Destroy the Heater Unit": "",
  "I've gotta destroy the heater so I can sneak in and repair it. When did I become such a scam artist?": "",
  "Meet Kaito": "",
  "Great eye, Kaito. I should hurry to his position.": "",
  "Obtain a Handyman Disguise": "",
  "Don Quijote probably has some generic handyman clothes.": "",
  "I've got everything I need. I'll meet up with Kaito-san on top of the building on Senryo Avenue.": "",
  "Find the Man Who Posted": "",
  "The guy who posted about the owner of Amour is apparently on Tenkaichi Street. I better see this with my own eyes.": "",
  "Go to a Sushi Place on Taihei Boulevard": "",
  "He really was there... Amazing. The owner of Amour is apparently at a sushi restaurant on Taihei Boulevard. I better move it.": "",
  "Hamura wasn't at Amour when Kume was murdered. Now if I can prove his alibi that he was at the sauna... But that's for another day.": "",
  "Report to Shintani": "",
  "I need to let Shintani know about Murase's statement. I'll meet him at Genda Law Office.": "",
  "Defeat the Kyorei Clan": "",
  "Just when we were getting to the good part! And dude, the streets are no place for that katana!": "",
  "Why would the Kyorei Clan stoop this low!? I've gotta rescue Seiya's younger sister!": "",
  "Meet up with Kaito": "",
  "The Kyorei Clan is probably expecting us. I should plan things out with Kaito-san.": "",
  "Find the Kyushu No. 1 Star Security Camera": "",
  "When Kume was murdered, Hamura was assaulting Seiya in Pink Alley near Kyushu No. 1 Star. That's the proof I need!": "",
  "Return to Yagami Detective Agency": "",
  "Kaito-san called. He didn't say it was urgent, but I should see what's up at the office.": "",
  "Wait for Shintani to Call": "",
  "Shintani is making arrangements to visit Hamura. Guess I'll kill time till he calls...": "",
  "The meeting with Hamura is set. I'll catch a cab to the station.": "",
  "Damn, I've hit a wall here. But apparently a cop named Ayabe has been leaking intel? Maybe I'll find him at Tender.": "",
  "Head to Stardust": "",
  "Hamura clocked some host on the night of the murder! Maybe he can prove Hamura's alibi. Stardust is on Tenkaichi Street.": "",
  "Find the Woman Who Posted": "",
  "Seiya is our host, but he's with a client. I'll have to find a woman who would go for Seiya.": "",
  "Meet with Seiya": "",
  "He's at Kanrai on Shichifuku Street, huh? Just stay put, would you?": "",
  "Chase After Mafuyu": "",
  "...I should walk Mafuyu back.": "",
  "Talk with Shintani": "",
  "Hamura's been indicted... I should check with Shintani to see how he's going to proceed.": "",
  "Head to Murase's Room": "",
  "The disguise is perfect. I'll go in as a repairman and head for Murase's office.": "",
  "Rescue Seiya's Sister": "",
  "Rescue Seiya's sister while Kaito distracts the Kyorei Clan!": "",
  "Test 1": "",
  "Test Content 1": "",
  "Test Explanation 1": "",
  "Test 2": "",
  "Test Content 2": "",
  "Test Explanation 2": "",
  "Test 3": "",
  "Test Content 3": "",
  "Test Explanation 3": "",
  "Really, guys? I better get these fools out of my way.": "",
  "Defeat Kasai": "",
  "What is the Keihin Gang? ": "",
  "So Chairman Kajihira has suspicions about AD-9 beyond the land buyout. But that's for Hoshino-kun to look into. I've gotta crash.": "",
  "Meet Hoshino": "",
  "Six months back, the ADDC's vice director, Hashiki, was murdered. Does Hoshino-kun know anything yet?": "",
  "Head to L'Amant": "",
  "Surely the police have investigated Hashiki's murder. But who's going to be Ayabe's substitute?": "",
  "Find Ayabe's Replacement": "",
  "Ayabe's substitute should be at L'Amant. Guess I'll have to hope he finds me.": "",
  "Investigate the Documents with Kaito": "",
  "Whew, dodged a bullet there. I almost flirted with her. Credit where it's due, Mafuyu. Maybe you'd make it as a detective yourself. Anyway, I better check these documents.": "",
  "He wants to give me a job? Sucks to be him, because I'm not taking it.": "",
  "Looks like Seiya's little sister is safe... Now I just have to clean up the mess and get back to court!": "",
  "Go Into Queen Rouge": "",
  "Queen Rouge isn't open yet. Convenient. I'll ask around to see if anyone remembers what happened six months ago.": "",
  "Go to the Hashiki Murder Crime Scene": "",
  "I should check out where they found Hashiki's body, near a spot called Queen Rouge on Pink Street.": "",
  "Head to Queen Rouge": "",
  "So Hashiki was drinking there with Shono before he died. It's six months cold, but people should probably still remember it.": "",
  "Get Sweets for the Bribe": "",
  "Saori-san's our only hope of getting into this cabaret club. Maybe if I bribe her with sweets from Takemitsu on Shichifuku Street...": "",
  "Bribe Saori": "",
  "These are the most popular treats I could get my hands on. Saori-san will melt before them! ...I hope.": "",
  "Warn Shintani": "",
  "The Kyorei Clan might go after Hamura's lawyer, which was Shintani. I should warn him.": "",
  "Leave Genda Law Office": "",
  "This isn't just a turf war? What more does Shintani know about the Mole?": "",
  "So the Kyorei Clan has backing from the Kajihira Group, some construction company with connections between its president and the Ministry of Health. I need to look into this.": "",
  "So, we have mutual interests, Fumiya Sugiura. He wants Kajihira, I want the Mole. That was enough for today, though...": "",
  "Report to Genda": "",
  "Shintani was murdered, probably by the Mole. The question is why, though? This'll be hard to tell Genda-sensei...": "",
  "Rest up at Genda Law Office": "",
  "My office is still cordoned off by the cops. I'll crash at the old place tonight.": "",
  "Head to Charles": "",
  "Shintani's last call was to the Advanced Drug Development Center. But why? I'll meet Hoshino-kun at Charles and get started on the answer.": "",
  "Head to the ADDC": "",
  "Why did Shintani call them? I'll have to go there myself to find the answer.": "",
  "Head to the Reception Desk": "",
  "This place hasn't changed at all...": "",
  "Follow Terasawa": "",
  "Our client, Okubo-kun, is still asserting he's innocent, so I'm going to be thorough. I'll start with the room of the victim, Waku-san.": "",
  "Investigate the Room": "",
  "If I'm done with the hospital room, then the next place would be...": "",
  "I don't care what Shintani says, I choose to believe my client. Next I'll search the parking lot where the truck that carried the body parked. ": "",
  "Buy a Dress": "",
  "I wasn't expecting Hoshino to be so into this. Well, I better pick up a dress suitable for a hostess.": "",
  "Head to Cherry": "",
  "So Saori and Mafuyu were pretty close? Anyway, hair and makeup time. Let's hit that hair salon on Showa Street.": "",
  "Speak with Genda": "",
  "Genda-sensei looks really serious. That couldn't be good.": "",
  "Defeat the Shady Men": "",
  "How dare they break the door!? I'm the one who's gonna get scolded by the landlady!": "",
  "Defeat Kengo's Crew": "",
  "I was holding back to avoid causing trouble for Matsugane-san. But now I get to pay you back for all those times you kicked my ass, Kengo!": "",
  "Escape the Matsugane Family": "",
  "Not sticking around to face the barrel of a gun, thanks! I'll have to trust this guy!": "",
  "Talk to the Receptionist": "",
  "I'm a material witness? Does Kuroiwa seriously suspect me? Kido wants me out, but can I still get to Shono?": "",
  "Check the Directory": "",
  "The receptionist was no use. I'll find Shono some other way.": "",
  "Follow Hashimoto": "",
  "Hashimoto-san is on Shono's research staff. Good to see some diversity in the workforce.": "",
  "Talk to Shono": "",
  "I found him! I have to ask why Shintani called.": "",
  "Head to Koi Bride": "",
  "Sugiura works quick. I'll head to Koi Bride to get the details on Kajihira.": "",
  "So Kajihira has a grudge against AD-9 for stalling the buyout. Interesting theory, but it's Hattori of all people who wrote it...": "",
  "Listen to Mafuyu": "",
  "Looks like I just missed Hattori. Bummer. But why is Mafuyu here?": "",
  "Head to Honmaruen": "",
  "Those Kyorei guys who tried to kidnap Mafuyu went to a cabaret club called Honmaruen. I've got you now.": "",
  "It's been a while. Maybe Saori-san called the office, so I'll head there.": "",
  "Saori-san is waiting for me at Tender. But damn, how do you score a date with a hostess that quick? I need tips.": "",
  "I hope Saori-san isn't considering a career in cabarets after this... No way, right? I better walk her back to Genda Law Office all the same.": "",
  "What a crazy day. But tomorrow's gonna be worse, when I meet Izumida on his home turf. Better rest up.": "",
  "Take a Taxi to the Prosecutor's Office": "",
  "Time for my meeting with Izumida. I have to defend myself, but will he even listen?": "",
  "Wait for Higashi to Call": "",
  "So Matsugane-san is on the Kyorei Clan's hit list too? He's somewhere safe though, so I'll need Higashi to organize the meeting.": "",
  "Head to Kamuro Kikunoya": "",
  "Not a place I know, but I can meet Matsugane-san at Kamuro Kikunoya. He'll have my answers, though, so I better not keep him waiting. I'll take a taxi.": "",
  "Find Tashiro": "",
  "Yep, only one guy dresses like that, so nobody's going to look too closely at the face, right? Better find the guy.": "",
  "Defeat Tashiro-kun": "",
  "Are you shitting me? This is the outfit I have to wear?": "",
  "How'd I know this is how it'd turn out? Long as the wiretaps hold, I just need to clear a path out of here!": "",
  "Defeat the Gambler": "",
  "Why did I have to pick the most annoying guy to talk to...": ""
 },
